@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Employee
participant "System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks to create a scenario for a map
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows the list of available maps
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a map
    activate System

    System --> Employee : asks for a year for the scenario to take place
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : types a year
    activate System

    System --> Employee : shows the list of locomotive types and asks to \n choose the ones that will be available in the scenario
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects the wanted locomotive types
    activate System

    System --> Employee : shows the list of industry types and asks to \n choose the ones that will be available in the scenario
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects the wanted industry types
    activate System

    System --> Employee : shows list of resources and asks for \nimportation availability in ports
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System :  types importation availability and resources to import
    activate System

    System --> Employee : shows list of resources and asks for \nexportation availability in ports
        deactivate System

        Employee -> System : types exportation availability and resources to export
        activate System

    System --> Employee : shows the list of industry changers and asks to \n choose the ones that will affect the scenario
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects the wanted industry changers
    activate System

    System --> Employee : shows all data and asks for confirmation
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms all data
    activate System

    System --> Employee : creates the scenario and displays success
    deactivate System
@enduml